---
import "../styles/maps-landing.css";
import siteNavigation from "../../../assets/site-nav.js?raw";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>N3XRA Maps | Know Exactly Where Everything Is</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Map meters, valves, hydrants, infrastructure, boundaries, and field locations in one secure N3XRA workspace." />
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://n3xra.com/maps/" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="N3XRA" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="N3XRA Maps | Know Exactly Where Everything Is" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="A simple, field-ready way to map the assets and infrastructure your organization depends on." />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://n3xra.com/maps/" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#071311" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/n3xra_logo_transparent_small.png" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site-nav.css?v=4" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/home-shell.css?v=1" />
    <script is:inline set:html={siteNavigation}></script>
  </head>
  <body data-assistant-product="Maps">
    <a class="maps-skip" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="site-topbar home-topbar maps-topbar">
      <div class="site-topbar-inner"><div class="site-topbar-row">
        <a class="site-brand home-brand" href="/" aria-label="N3XRA home"><img src="/assets/n3xra_logo_transparent_small.png" alt="" /><span>N3XRA</span></a>
        <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Maps page"><a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a><a href="#layers">Layers</a><a href="#field-ready">Field ready</a><a href="#future">What comes next</a></nav>
        <div class="site-nav-actions"><a class="site-menu-link maps-signin" href="/maps/app/">Open Maps</a><button class="site-menu-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="maps-mobile-menu" aria-label="Open menu" data-site-menu-toggle><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div>
      </div><nav class="site-mobile-menu" id="maps-mobile-menu" aria-label="Mobile navigation" hidden><div class="site-mobile-menu-head"><p class="site-mobile-menu-title">N3XRA Maps</p></div><a class="site-menu-link" href="#how-it-works">How it works</a><a class="site-menu-link" href="#layers">Layers</a><a class="site-menu-link" href="#field-ready">Field ready</a><a class="site-menu-link" href="/maps/app/">Open Maps</a></nav></div>
    </header>

    <main id="main-content">
      <section class="maps-hero"><div class="maps-shell maps-hero-grid">
        <div class="maps-hero-copy"><p class="maps-kicker">N3XRA MAPS</p><h1>Every asset.<br /><em>Right where it belongs.</em></h1><p class="maps-hero-lede">Map meters, valves, hydrants, infrastructure, service areas, and anything else your organization needs to find—on the map and in the field.</p><div class="maps-actions"><a class="maps-button is-primary" href="/support/?product=maps">Request early access</a><a class="maps-button is-secondary" href="#how-it-works">See how it works</a></div><p class="maps-availability"><i></i> N3XRA Maps is entering early access</p></div>
        <div class="maps-product-preview" aria-label="N3XRA Maps product preview"><div class="preview-window">
          <header><span><b>N3</b><em>XRA</em> Maps</span><small>FIELD WORKSPACE</small></header>
          <div class="preview-body"><aside><p>MAP LIBRARY</p><h2>Water District</h2><label><span>⌕</span> Search mapped items</label><div class="preview-layer is-active"><i>M</i><span><strong>Meters</strong><small>1,284 locations</small></span><b>✓</b></div><div class="preview-layer"><i class="is-valve">V</i><span><strong>Valves</strong><small>186 locations</small></span><b>✓</b></div><div class="preview-layer"><i class="is-boundary">◇</i><span><strong>District boundary</strong><small>Reference layer</small></span><b>✓</b></div></aside>
            <div class="preview-map"><div class="terrain t1"></div><div class="terrain t2"></div><div class="terrain t3"></div><span class="road road-a"></span><span class="road road-b"></span><span class="road road-c"></span><span class="map-label label-a">Pine Street</span><span class="map-label label-b">River Road</span><button class="preview-pin pin-a">M</button><button class="preview-pin is-valve pin-b">V</button><button class="preview-pin pin-c">M</button><button class="preview-pin pin-d">M</button><div class="current-location"><i></i><span>YOU</span></div><article class="preview-detail"><span>METER</span><strong>Service Meter 0472</strong><small>Account reference · 0472</small><div><b>8 ft away</b><em>GPS accuracy ±6 ft</em></div></article><div class="preview-map-style"><b>Map</b><span>Satellite</span></div></div>
          </div>
        </div></div>
      </div></section>

      <section class="maps-problem" aria-labelledby="problem-title"><div class="maps-shell maps-problem-grid"><p>BUILT FOR THE MOMENT YOU NEED IT</p><h2 id="problem-title">Snow can hide the meter.<br /><em>The map still knows where it is.</em></h2><div><p>Open the asset, start field locating, and walk toward its recorded position. N3XRA Maps shows the remaining distance and the accuracy your device is currently reporting.</p><p>No paper map. No guessing at landmarks. No relying on the one person who remembers where it was installed.</p></div></div></section>

      <section class="maps-steps" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="steps-title"><div class="maps-shell"><header class="maps-section-heading"><p class="maps-kicker">HOW IT WORKS</p><h2 id="steps-title">From a blank map to a field-ready system.</h2></header><div class="maps-step-grid"><article><span>01</span><div class="step-symbol">▧</div><h3>Create your layers</h3><p>Organize the map around the things you manage: meters, valves, hydrants, lines, boundaries, tax lots, and reference maps.</p></article><article><span>02</span><div class="step-symbol">＋</div><h3>Place each location</h3><p>Drop a pin manually or stand at the asset and record the location from a phone with its reported GPS accuracy.</p></article><article><span>03</span><div class="step-symbol">⌖</div><h3>Find it again</h3><p>Search the master list, open the mapped item, and use live distance guidance to walk back to the recorded location.</p></article></div></div></section>

      <section class="maps-layers-showcase" id="layers" aria-labelledby="layers-title"><div class="maps-shell maps-layer-layout"><div class="maps-layer-copy"><p class="maps-kicker">YOUR MAP, YOUR STRUCTURE</p><h2 id="layers-title">Give every kind of information its own layer.</h2><p>Turn layers on and off, choose their color and icon, search across mapped items, and keep operational assets separate from reference information.</p><ul><li>Points for meters, valves, hydrants, pumps, and manholes</li><li>Lines for mains, service lines, roads, and routes</li><li>Polygons for districts, tax boundaries, parcels, and service areas</li><li>Map overlays prepared for imported reference imagery</li></ul></div><div class="layer-stack" aria-label="Example map layers"><article class="meter"><i>M</i><span><small>POINT LAYER</small><strong>Water meters</strong><p>Individual service locations</p></span><b>1,284</b></article><article class="valve"><i>V</i><span><small>POINT LAYER</small><strong>System valves</strong><p>Isolation and control assets</p></span><b>186</b></article><article class="main"><i>⌁</i><span><small>LINE LAYER</small><strong>Water mains</strong><p>Distribution infrastructure</p></span><b>42 mi</b></article><article class="boundary"><i>◇</i><span><small>REFERENCE LAYER</small><strong>Tax and district boundaries</strong><p>Jurisdiction and parcel context</p></span><b>ON</b></article></div></div></section>

      <section class="maps-field" id="field-ready" aria-labelledby="field-title"><div class="maps-shell maps-field-grid"><div class="field-phone" aria-hidden="true"><div class="phone-map"><span class="phone-road one"></span><span class="phone-road two"></span><i class="phone-target">V</i><i class="phone-user"></i></div><div class="phone-card"><span>VALVE</span><h3>North isolation valve</h3><strong>3 ft away</strong><small>Current GPS accuracy ±4 ft</small><button>Use my location</button></div></div><div class="maps-field-copy"><p class="maps-kicker">FIELD READY</p><h2 id="field-title">Designed to leave the office.</h2><p>N3XRA Maps works in the browser on a phone, tablet, or computer. Field crews get the same searchable map and asset details without learning a full desktop GIS system.</p><div class="field-points"><span><b>Live proximity</b>See how far you are from the selected asset.</span><span><b>Honest accuracy</b>See the accuracy reported by the current device.</span><span><b>Satellite view</b>Switch context when streets and landmarks are not enough.</span><span><b>High-accuracy ready</b>External GNSS support can be added for tighter field requirements.</span></div></div></div></section>

      <section class="maps-control" aria-labelledby="control-title"><div class="maps-shell maps-control-grid"><div><p class="maps-kicker">SIMPLE TO USE. SERIOUS ABOUT DATA.</p><h2 id="control-title">One organization. The right access for every person.</h2></div><div class="control-cards"><article><span>OWNER</span><h3>Account administrators</h3><p>Control the workspace and decide who can manage or view map information.</p></article><article><span>TEAM</span><h3>Editors and viewers</h3><p>Let field staff add locations while keeping read-only access available where appropriate.</p></article><article><span>DATA</span><h3>Organization-owned records</h3><p>Every layer and mapped item stays separated by organization with database-level access controls.</p></article></div></div></section>

      <section class="maps-future" id="future" aria-labelledby="future-title"><div class="maps-shell maps-future-grid"><div><p class="maps-kicker">BUILT TO GROW</p><h2 id="future-title">The map becomes the connection point.</h2></div><p>Today, N3XRA Maps focuses on layers, locations, search, and field finding. The structure is already prepared to connect meters to customer accounts, open permitted billing details, attach work orders, and preserve asset history as those systems are added.</p></div></section>

      <section class="maps-cta" aria-labelledby="cta-title"><div class="maps-shell"><p class="maps-kicker">N3XRA MAPS EARLY ACCESS</p><h2 id="cta-title">Start with the map.<br />Build the system around it.</h2><p>Paid plans and guided onboarding are being prepared. Request early access or sign in if Maps has already been connected to your organization.</p><div class="maps-actions"><a class="maps-button is-primary" href="/support/?product=maps">Request early access</a><a class="maps-button is-secondary" href="/maps/app/">Open Maps</a></div></div></section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer home-footer"><div class="page-shell footer-grid"><div class="footer-brand"><a class="home-brand" href="/" aria-label="N3XRA home"><img src="/assets/n3xra_logo_transparent_small.png" alt="" /><span>N3XRA</span></a><p>N3XRA builds connected software, websites, automation, and AI solutions for people and organizations bringing new ideas to life.</p></div><nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Company"><p>Explore</p><a href="/projects/">Projects</a><a href="/services/">Services</a><a href="/support/">Support</a><a href="/careers/">Careers</a></nav><nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Software"><p>Software</p><a href="/maps/">Maps</a><a href="/project-cards/">Project Cards</a><a href="/contact-card/">Contact Card</a><a href="/records/">Records</a></nav><nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Account and legal"><p>N3XRA</p><a href="/account">Dashboard</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/terms/">Terms</a><a href="/invest/">Invest</a></nav></div><div class="page-shell footer-bottom"><p>&copy; 2026 N3XRA LLC. All rights reserved.</p><p>Built by <a href="https://quentinnichols.com/">Quentin Nichols</a>.</p></div></footer>
  </body>
</html>
